# --- Levy paper reproducibility exceptions ---
# Keep large raw/processed data ignored, but allow small files needed to rebuild
# or audit the current paper figures.
!analysis/levy_paper/metadata/
!analysis/levy_paper/metadata/**
# NFF schedule exports are local AWS-rebuild inputs and are not redistributed.
analysis/levy_paper/metadata/schedules/*.xlsx
!analysis/levy_paper/data/
analysis/levy_paper/data/**
!analysis/levy_paper/data/README.md
!analysis/levy_paper/data/cache_bundle_manifest.csv
!analysis/levy_paper/figures/**/*.csv
!analysis/levy_paper/figures/**/*.json
!analysis/levy_paper/figures/**/*.md
!analysis/levy_paper/figures/**/*.txt
!analysis/levy_paper/reports/
analysis/levy_paper/reports/**
!analysis/levy_paper/reports/publication_reproducibility_check.csv

